Rule {Number} ({Description})\n{Rule Definition}
Ex) Rule 21 (primitive type variable should not be zero)
    {v_1 : int ⊎ float} |= v_1 ≠ 0

[Example Rules]
Rule 14 (tensor should not be empty)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) − 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0

Rule 23 (3-dimensional tensor with all positive shape dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 3 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) − 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0

Rule 7 (first dimension of a tensor matches second dimension of the other)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 1 ∧ ndim(v_2) ≥ 2 ∧ shape(v_1, 0) = shape(v_2, 1)

